SUMMARY:South Carolina: SC1065 due
DESCRIPTION:South Carolina partnership return due the 15th day of the 3rd m
 onth after year-end. Correction (this rebuild session): the cited source st
 ates the general rule (15th day of the 3rd month) without addressing the 20
 26-specific weekend interaction - March 15\, 2026 is a Sunday. Consistent w
 ith every other state in this data set that explicitly confirms a weekend-s
 hift policy (e.g. Massachusetts\, New York\, Vermont\, Delaware\, Montana\,
  Oregon all confirm shifting to March 16\, 2026)\, and with the near-univer
 sal US government-deadline convention of shifting to the next business day\
 , this entry's date_2026 was corrected from an unshifted March 15\, 2026 to
  March 16\, 2026. This is a computed application of the general shift conve
 ntion\, not an independently re-fetched per-state confirmation that this sp
 ecific state's statute shifts - flagged here for transparency. | South Caro
