  application of the general shift convention\, not an independently re-fetc
 hed per-state confirmation that this specific state's statute shifts - flag
 ged here for transparency. | Authority: South Carolina Department of Revenu
 e\, direct fetch this session: "Annual returns and your Partnership Tax pay
