DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250421
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250422
SUMMARY:Nevada: State sales & use tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Effective with the February 2026 filing period\, due the 20th o
 f the month following the reporting period (accelerated from the prior last
 -day-of-following-month rule under AB 594 - a recent change\; older seconda
 ry sources may still show the old rule). | Q1 2026 (Jan-Mar) sales tax retu
 rn\, applying Nevada's quarterly-filer due-date rule: Effective with the Fe
 bruary 2026 filing period\, due the 20th of the month following the reporti
 ng period (accelerated from the prior last-day-of-following-month rule unde
 r AB 594 - a recent change\; older secondary sources may still show the old
  rule). This is a representative recurring pattern\, not a single annual de
 adline - actual filing frequency (monthly/quarterly/annual) is assigned per
  business by the state. | Authority: Direct fetch of Nevada's own tax agenc
 y site this session | Source: https://tax.nv.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/01
 /Department-of-Taxation-New-Sales-Tax-filing-date.pdf | This date is comput
 ed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\; co
 nfirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
